---
// Closing call-to-action band promoting the free video audit.
---

<section class="section section--navy cta" aria-labelledby="audit-cta-title">
  <svg class="waves" viewBox="0 0 1200 120" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M0 60c150-50 300-50 450 0s300 50 450 0 225-40 300-20" fill="none" stroke="var(--teal)" stroke-width="2" opacity=".55"></path>
    <path d="M0 85c150-50 300-50 450 0s300 50 450 0 225-40 300-20" fill="none" stroke="var(--coral)" stroke-width="2" opacity=".45"></path>
  </svg>
  <div class="container narrow center">
    <p class="eyebrow">Free video audit</p>
    <h2 id="audit-cta-title">Not sure if your current site is hurting you?</h2>
    <p class="lead-inv">
      I’ll record a free 5-minute video audit of your website: specific, honest feedback on what’s working, what’s not,
      and what I’d fix first. No obligation.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center">
      <a href="/free-website-audit/" class="btn btn--primary">Get your free site audit</a>
    </div>
    <p class="muted small">I review a limited number of sites each month. Expect your video within 24–48 hours.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .waves {
    position: absolute;
    inset: auto 0 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 7.5rem;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .container {
    position: relative;
  }
  .lead-inv {
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .small {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
